{"id":"n91758-1-7","stage":2,"title":"종일 · 整天","scene":"说明与表达","roles":["说话人 A","说话人 B"],"lines":[{"id":"n91758-1-7-1","ko":"지난 주말에는 뭐하셨어요?","zh":"上周末您都做了什么？","note":"点不懂的词，看本句词义、助词和语尾；听词语后，再听整句。","parts":[{"text":"지난","meaning":"过， 度过","explanation":"지나다：过， 度过；ㄴ：修饰后面的名词。形容词后表示当前性质；动词后通常表示已完成的动作或结果状态。","readings":[{"term":"지나다","audio":"/audio/7d68e3b7dc1c001cae3b.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"82142","senseId":"4","lemma":"지나다","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}],"surfaceReading":{"term":"지난","audio":"/audio/1589c16515823209ca51.mp3"}},{"text":"주말에는","meaning":"周末","explanation":"주말：周末；에：格助词，表示时间、位置、去向、对象等；需结合整句理解；는：话题或对比助词。","readings":[{"term":"주말","audio":"/audio/dc80d0fe247835379f4f.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"19548","senseId":"1","lemma":"주말","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}],"surfaceReading":{"term":"주말에는","audio":"/audio/0b27d6d47879bf3eaa83.mp3"}},{"text":"뭐하셨어요?","meaning":"什么；做，干","explanation":"뭐：什么；하다：做，干；시：主语敬语，尊敬动作或状态的主体；었：过去或完成，常与词干缩合；어요：礼貌句末；可随语调表示陈述或询问。","readings":[{"term":"뭐","audio":"/audio/95b5c8cf1b249b7a376b.mp3"},{"term":"하다","audio":"/audio/505de0a2f6be73fa7758.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"84991","senseId":"2","lemma":"뭐","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"},{"entryId":"73277","senseId":"1","lemma":"하다","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}],"surfaceReading":{"term":"뭐하셨어요","audio":"/audio/682523d3010d23d19cd7.mp3"}}],"words":[{"id":"7d68e3b7dc1c001c","term":"지나다","zh":"过， 度过","audio":"/audio/7d68e3b7dc1c001cae3b.mp3","entryId":"82142","definition":"超过某个时期或限度。","pronunciation":["지나다"]},{"id":"dc80d0fe24783537","term":"주말","zh":"周末","audio":"/audio/dc80d0fe247835379f4f.mp3","entryId":"19548","definition":"一周的尽头。","pronunciation":["주말"]},{"id":"95b5c8cf1b249b7a","term":"뭐","zh":"什么","audio":"/audio/95b5c8cf1b249b7a376b.mp3","entryId":"84991","definition":"指代不确定的对象或无需指明名字的对象。","pronunciation":["뭐ː"]},{"id":"505de0a2f6be73fa","term":"하다","zh":"做，干","audio":"/audio/505de0a2f6be73fa7758.mp3","entryId":"73277","definition":"进行某种行动、动作或活动。","pronunciation":["하다"]}],"audio":"/audio/0dae4928a873f81caf17.mp3","speakerIndex":0},{"id":"n91758-1-7-2","ko":"몸이 안 좋아서 종일을 집에만 있었어요.","zh":"因为身体不舒服，一整天都待在家里。","note":"点不懂的词，看本句词义、助词和语尾；听词语后，再听整句。","parts":[{"text":"몸이","meaning":"身体，身子","explanation":"몸：身体，身子；이：主格助词，标记主语。","readings":[{"term":"몸","audio":"/audio/955149b012635be1833c.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"74138","senseId":"1","lemma":"몸","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}],"surfaceReading":{"term":"몸이","audio":"/audio/5a8fb4d5acf8e6fe3214.mp3"}},{"text":"안","meaning":"不","explanation":"안：不。","readings":[{"term":"안","audio":"/audio/bc00bc8172c83d5fab70.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"71372","senseId":"1","lemma":"안","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}],"surfaceReading":{"term":"안","audio":"/audio/bc00bc8172c83d5fab70.mp3"}},{"text":"좋아서","meaning":"好，良好","explanation":"좋다：好，良好；어서：连接原因与结果，或前后相接的动作。","readings":[{"term":"좋다","audio":"/audio/86d0464f1c6da40233cd.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"79033","senseId":"4","lemma":"좋다","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}],"surfaceReading":{"term":"좋아서","audio":"/audio/20c80ad71fb9f70ae651.mp3"}},{"text":"종일을","meaning":"整天，一天到晚","explanation":"종일：整天，一天到晚；을：宾格助词，标记动作对象。","readings":[{"term":"종일","audio":"/audio/02f69fc1875bf3107006.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"91758","senseId":"1","lemma":"종일","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}],"surfaceReading":{"term":"종일을","audio":"/audio/2afe343e56ed54925f07.mp3"}},{"text":"집에만","meaning":"家","explanation":"집：家；에：格助词，表示时间、位置、去向、对象等；需结合整句理解；만：表示“只、仅”。","readings":[{"term":"집","audio":"/audio/99cf116bb12cf1061e0b.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"71358","senseId":"3","lemma":"집","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}],"surfaceReading":{"term":"집에만","audio":"/audio/5bb0b3182be208cbe93e.mp3"}},{"text":"있었어요.","meaning":"在，待，住","explanation":"있다：在，待，住；었：过去或完成，常与词干缩合；어요：礼貌句末；可随语调表示陈述或询问。","readings":[{"term":"있다","audio":"/audio/96fe52db2531c9e73e53.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"68797","sen